WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.180
The primary effect of these brutal green energy policies

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:06.860
has not been to help the environment,

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:09.180
but to redistribute manufacturing

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.660
and industrial activity from developed countries

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:14.620
that follow the insane rules

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:17.540
that are put down to polluting countries

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:20.879
that break the rules and are making a fortune.

00:00:20.879 --> 00:00:21.780
They're making a fortune.

